<urn:atm:triage:finding/BB3-015>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BB3-015" ;
  triage:title "report_runtime.py's shared compose()/source_revision() module has no direct unit test" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB3-QA3-1789250000 (Final verdict FAIL, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1445#issuecomment-5648698551, 2026-09-12T21:08:20Z; BB3-QA3-I1, confirmed independently by arch-qa and ruthless-boundary-qa), reviewed at 66be1d012. This round's new shared compose()/source_revision() module (scripts/smoke/report_runtime.py) has no direct test file. All 7 consumers (colima_skill_report.py, run_feature_smoke.py, benchmark_report.py, read_benchmark.py, run_admission_capacity.py, run_inbound_peer_smoke.py, scripts/fuzz/render_report.py) mock the wrapper in their own tests, so the module's real behavior (GIT_REVISION full-match validation, subprocess failure path, tempfile cleanup in finally, per-caller error_type substitution) is never exercised end-to-end." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "test-coverage" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:source "qa" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "scripts/smoke/report_runtime.py" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T21:08:20Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "Fix: add scripts/smoke/test_report_runtime.py with direct unit coverage of GIT_REVISION validation, the subprocess failure path, tempfile cleanup in finally, and per-caller error_type substitution. Routed to solar's BB3-FIX-R3-1789253000 (fenix, promote_to_branch fix/bb3-qa3-r3, queued behind BB1-FIX-R1). cipher's BB3-FIX-R4-1789255000 (task event 2026-09-12T23:08:15Z) reported this not-reproducible at the current, already-satisfied path on fix/bb3-qa3-r4 @ f94125cf5 (PR #1455, includes merges of #1456 d1969185f and #1453 1c7e76da5); just lint 36/36, just test exit 0, just smoke fast 8/8. Fixed-pending-QA (verify-not-reproducible); QA dispatched as BB3-QA4-1789262000 on PR #1455 (queued behind BB5-QA-R1) to confirm against the record. Core defect FIXED at f94125cf5 under BB3-QA4-1789262000 (PR #1455 comment, 2026-09-12T23:24:52Z) by two dedicated commits this round (59ebfad08, 16d97d4b6) adding scripts/smoke/test_report_runtime.py -- confirmed independently by req-qa and arch-qa; also corrected cipher's own close report, which had mislabeled this 'not-reproducible'. REOPENED per fenix's correction (2026-09-12T23:32:13Z): not fully closed -- residual (Important, quality-mgr's ATM-QA-002) is two of the four originally-named behaviors still untested (source_revision()'s subprocess-failure branch; resolve_procedure_page()'s GIT_REVISION regex on a malformed string). In the BB3-FIX-R5-1789264000 fence, closes on cipher's fix at fix/bb3-qa4-r5 (cut from a7d4664d1, feature/bb6-storage-prompt-handoffs, top of stack #1457). cipher's BB3 R5 final push landed at fix/bb3-qa4-r5 @ 5da523f81 (parent merge-forward 16f2ab124), 2026-09-13T00:45:41Z, self-reported fresh just smoke fast 8/8, evidence archived outside tree, reports index unchanged. Fixed-pending-QA. Per cipher's task-close (relayed by fenix, 2026-09-13T00:52:35Z), this finding's fix landed at f6214af22. QA-R5 dispatched (BB3-QA-R5-1789273000) on PR #1463 @ 5da523f81, frozen, base ref for the diff 40ccd403e." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BB3 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-09-12T21:08:20Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
