  triage:resolutionNote "genuinely FIXED by two dedicated commits this round (59ebfad08, 16d97d4b6) adding scripts/smoke/test_report_runtime.py, resolving the core 'zero coverage' defect -- confirmed independently by req-qa and arch-qa. quality-mgr's BB3-QA4 explicitly corrected cipher's own close report, which had mislabeled this 'not-reproducible'; the code is fine, only that label was wrong. Residual gap (Important, non-blocking): two of the four originally-named behaviors are still untested (source_revision()'s subprocess-failure branch; resolve_procedure_page()'s GIT_REVISION regex on a malformed string) -- recommended for the next layer, does not block this closure." ;
